### Variables
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@testRoot = /data/obsidian-test-lib

### Get server info
GET {{baseUrl}}/info

### Rebuild index
POST {{baseUrl}}/index/rebuild
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "root": "{{testRoot}}"
}

### Search for Java
POST {{baseUrl}}/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "Java programming",
  "top_k": 5
}

### Search with collection filter
POST {{baseUrl}}/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "Java",
  "top_k": 5,
  "collection": "docs"
}

### Answer with RAG
POST {{baseUrl}}/answer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What is Java programming?",
  "top_k": 5
}

### Answer - explain OOP
POST {{baseUrl}}/answer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "Explain object-oriented programming concepts",
  "top_k": 5
}